The four role files (product manager, frontend engineer, UI/UX designer, mock backend engineer) were written in June–July 2026 for the original single-file prototype (`index.html`). They describe a build approach that D-56 replaced (rebuild from scratch) and use pre-D-50 labels. They are kept in `docs/_superseded/roles-2026-06/` as history.

Use instead:
